  "prefLabel": "Nat 302.01 Application for Initial Licensure as a Doctor of Naturopathic Medicine",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-06-18",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 302.01 Application for Initial Licensure as a Doctor of Naturopathic Medicine. Persons who are not currently licensed as a doctor of naturopathic medicine or naturopathic physician in any state, the District of Columbia, or U.S. territory and who wish to apply for a license as a doctor of naturopathic medicine shall do so by submitting an application which contains:\n\n(a) The completed application form described in Nat 302.03;\n\n(b) The supporting materials specified by Nat 302.04; and\n\n(c) The license fee specified by Nat 307.01(a).\n\nSource. #6380, eff 11-26-96, EXPIRED: 11-26-04\n\nNew. #8374, eff 6-18-05, EXPIRED: 6-18-13\n\nNew. #12176, eff 5-17-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nat100-700.html"
